# Keep editor, operating system, and personal tooling ignores in your global
# git ignore.  Entries here are specific to this project, and each one carries
# a comment that justifies it.

# Ignore org-babel tangled Emacs Lisp files.
org/*.el
# Ignore any compiled lisp files that might make their way in due to tests.
*.elc
# Ignore Nix generated builds.
/result
# Ignore log files emitted while troubleshooting (largely from the LLM, and not
# a formal process in this repo)..
*.log
# Ignore Flycheck's temporary syntax-check files (flycheck_<filename>).  These
# are created when Flycheck checks a buffer and occasionally not cleaned up.
flycheck_*.el
# Ignore review-cli's verdict record.  It is per-checkout state keyed by base
# commit, not something to share.
review.json*
